  "description": "Rysy (2,499 m) from the Palenica Białczańska parking on the Polish side of the Tatras: 12.3 km and 1,530 m of ascent. The first 7.7 km follow the wide Droga Oswalda Balzera to Morskie Oko, then a footpath climbs past Czarny Staw and the Bula pod Rysami (2,055 m) to the summit. OpenStreetMap rates the upper section demanding alpine hiking (SAC T5): expect exposure and easy scrambling. Springs and the old PTTK hut at Morskie Oko are mapped along the way.\n\nRoute data © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). OSM relation/1594931.\nCover photo: Michal Klajban / CC BY-SA 3.0 / Wikimedia Commons.",
